        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਇੰਨਾ (innā) goes with Punjabi itṇā, which CDIAL lists under Sanskrit iyattaka, \"so little\", built on iyant, \"so much\" (CDIAL 1589). CDIAL does not list innā itself."
            }
