              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਹੋਰ (hor) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from apara, \"posterior; different, other\" (CDIAL 434). CDIAL lists Punjabi hor, \"other, more\"."
